# Pairs with NoCrossTenantMembership. An app's role compilation that keeps a
# stored binding to another tenant's group confers the role through it.
MODULE: RoleBindingSkipsTenantCheck
TARGET: NoCrossTenantMembership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: role compilation keeps a binding to a group outside the app's tenant
PERTURBS: Count

--- FIND
        roles == IF \A b \in bindings : Bindable(b) THEN bindings \cap groups ELSE {}
--- REPLACE
        roles == bindings \cap groups
--- END